	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0>Sweltering humidity welcomes our two teams into battle. There are two Objectives widely separated from the two Bases makes tactical choices critical.\n<f1>Map created for <f2>hvMechWarrior<f1> by <f2>hvPalantirion\n<f1>You can locate <f0>House Vagoroth<f1> at <f2>www.geocities.com/TimesSquare/Fortress/5514";